3. CONVERT LIST OF STRINGS TO UPPERCASE
==============================================================================

INPUT:

List<String> fruits = Arrays.asList("banana", "apple");

CODE:

List<String> result = fruits.stream()
        .map(String::toUpperCase)
        .collect(Collectors.toList());

System.out.println(result);

OUTPUT:

[BANANA, APPLE]

JAVA 16+ ALTERNATIVE:

List<String> result = fruits.stream()
        .map(String::toUpperCase)
        .toList();

Since the interview discussion specifies Java 8, use collectors.toList().

