6. FIRST NON-REPEATED CHARACTER IN "SWISS"
PLAIN JAVA WITHOUT STREAMS
==============================================================================

CODE:

String str = "SWISS";

Map<Character, Integer> frequency =
        new LinkedHashMap<>();

for (char ch : str.toCharArray()) {
    frequency.put(
            ch,
            frequency.getOrDefault(ch, 0) + 1
    );
}

for (char ch : str.toCharArray()) {
    if (frequency.get(ch) == 1) {
        System.out.println(ch);
        break;
    }
}

OUTPUT:

W

EXPLANATION:

Frequency:

S = 3
W = 1
I = 1

The second loop follows the original string order, so W is returned first.

