7. TIME COMPLEXITY
==============================================================================

First loop:

O(N)

Second loop:

O(N)

Total:

O(N) + O(N) = O(N)

Space Complexity:

O(K)

K represents the number of distinct characters.

INTERVIEW ANSWER:

"The time complexity is O(N) because we traverse the string twice, and
2N is simplified to N. The auxiliary space is O(K)."

