8. RETURN HIGHEST SALARY
==============================================================================

Only highest salary:

SELECT MAX(salary) AS highest_salary
FROM employee;

Employee having the highest salary:

SELECT id, name, salary
FROM employee
WHERE salary = (
    SELECT MAX(salary)
    FROM employee
);

The second query returns all employees tied for the highest salary.

