17. WERE YOUR SERVICES PRODUCERS OR CONSUMERS?
==============================================================================

Both.

Producer Example:

Risk Service publishes a status event.

kafkaTemplate.send(
        "risk-status-topic",
        riskId,
        event
);

Consumer Example:

Audit Service receives the event.

@KafkaListener(
    topics = "risk-status-topic",
    groupId = "audit-group"
)
public void consume(RiskStatusEvent event) {
    auditService.save(event);
}

INTERVIEW ANSWER:

"Our services acted as both producers and consumers. A service produced events
after a business change and consumed events belonging to its own downstream
responsibility."

